      "message": "\u003e We already have facilities to control the version string (the build number is embedded via that mechanism).\n\nCan you elaborate on the mechanism?\n\nWhen we pin common/kernel to android13-5.15-2023-02_r1, build vmlinux, and check the version string:\n- Without this patch: the version string is \"5.15.78-android13-8\"\n- With this patch: the version string is \"5.15.78-android13-8-android13-5.15-2023-02_r1\"\n\nSo, on a running device, how do we uniquely identify the kernel version without the patch? We don\u0027t really need SHA1 - we just need an identifier.\n\nPlease advise.",
